# Naamalu Design System v3

**Read `docs/design-system.md` before UI work.** Flow: `docs/smaranam-app-flow.md` until `naamalu-app-flow/SKILL.md` exists. Imagery: `docs/illustrations.md`.

Use `NaamaluTheme` / v3 tokens (`NaamaluColors`, `NaamaluModules`, `Sky`, `NaamaluDimens`). Foundation: `ui/icons/NaamaluIcons.kt`, `ui/landscape/LandscapeLayers.kt`, `ui/layout/NaamaluInsets.kt`.

Legacy `SmaranamTheme` maps to v3 tokens for transitional screens. New work follows §6–§7 components (Phase 2+), not v2 `MandirChrome` hairline rows.

§9 never-do: status/navigation insets, no empty icon boxes, no placeholder copy, hide zero session counts, no stock icon packs on product chrome.
